sider skipping.\n- Highly technical domain → Local models may lack domain knowledge. Weight flags lower.\n- Creative writing → Factual review doesn't apply well. Use only for logical consistency.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 1528, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/staybased/peer-review", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 87, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Peer Review", "ownerName": "staybased", "score": 22657.176749703438, "slug": "peer-review", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "agent-task-automation", "name": "任务自动化"}, {"key": "agent-multi-agent", "name": "多 Agent 协作"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781672733205, "upstream_owner_login": "staybased", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/staybased/peer-review", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "content-creation", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772768608242, "description": "Write Traditional Chinese that sounds human. Not formal, not robotic, not AI-generated.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 1527, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/ivangdavila/traditional-chinese", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 57, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Traditional Chinese", "ownerName": "ivangdavila", "score": 71809.95475113123, "slug": "traditional-chinese", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 3, "subCategories": [{"key": "content-article", "name": "文章写作"}, {"key": "content-rewrite", "name": "内容改写"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781672726248, "upstream_owner_login": "ivangdavila", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/ivangdavila/traditional-chinese", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779222432875, "description": "DEPRECATED — archived Pulse skill. Use x402janus for wallet security and monitoring.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 15